  "label": "Racial Trauma",
  "description": "The meme taps into the deep-seated racial trauma experienced by Black communities due to the legacy of slavery and systemic racism. By trivializing slavery as a 'choice' or 'taste', the meme attempts to normalize and downplay the horrors of human bondage, which is a form of psychological and cultural harm that continues to affect Black people today.",
